---
description: AppealHero project rules (applies to every task)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before making any change. In particular:

- Never give the LLM a tool that submits, approves or confirms facts.
- Change case state only through `transition()`; never assign `case.state` directly.
- Never weaken the approval token, the read-back gate or the network guard.
- Never contact boston.gov, rmcpay.com or any real government system.
- Keep `AI_MODE=fake` working; run `npm run typecheck && npm test` before finishing.
- Edit only the paths owned by your task card in `docs/TASKS.md`; propose shared-contract changes instead of making them.
